id: pm-brand-bun-lock
title: Use the npm lockfile for Bun dependency verification
description: Remove the independently maintained Bun lockfile and use the fleet npm-lockfile install pattern so Dependabot updates pass without manual lockfile repinning.
type: Task
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-18T18:18:36.955Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-18T18:24:01.821Z"
author: codex-agent
parent: pm-brand-kit
comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-18T18:18:40.978Z",codex-agent,"Fleet read-only comparison: pm-csv, pm-web and pm-graph track neither bun.lock nor bun.lockb, use npm Dependabot plus GitHub Actions entries (no bun ecosystem), and verify Bun installation with bun install --no-save. Adopt the same single npm lockfile pattern; preserve trusted-base identity controls and all release thresholds. Dependabot PR #8 should pass the lockfile step after merging this change and rebasing; recreation is unnecessary."
  "2026-10-18T18:20:14.013Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral configuration revert proof: PR #8 manifests plus the original committed Bun lockfile reproduce the frozen-lockfile error. Removing only that second lockfile and using bun install --no-save succeeds; all 11 direct development dependencies match package-lock.json, whose bytes remain unchanged. Bun 1.3.5 may generate a disposable ignored lock during npm migration; no Bun lock is committed. No application function changed. Trusted identity workflow, policy controls and thresholds are unchanged."
  "2026-10-18T18:23:59.961Z",codex-agent,"Pinned PM linked npm and Bun release:check passed under an isolated runner HOME and clean Git configuration: 66/66 tests each, zero failures, skips, cancellations or TODOs; 100/100/100/100 coverage at unchanged thresholds. Native bun test ./test/bun.acceptance.ts passed 2/2. Both packed consumers and all identity, strict health, typecheck, lint, docstring, font, build/assets, audit and changelog gates passed. Initial linked runner --env-set HOME seeded a global extension with a different host version; isolating the runner itself matched CI and resolved the local environment mismatch. Automatic test-result persistence remains disabled by existing policy; these observed results are recorded here."
files[2]{path,scope,note}:
  .github/workflows/ci.yml,project,Bun consumes npm lockfile
  .gitignore,project,Ignore disposable Bun lockfiles
tests[2]{command,scope,timeout_seconds,pm_context_mode,provenance{author,created_at,source_kind,source_ref}}:
  "npm run release:check",project,1200,tracker,codex-agent,"2026-10-18T18:20:39.200Z",local_mutation,fix/dependabot-bun-lockfile
  "bun run release:check",project,1200,tracker,codex-agent,"2026-10-18T18:20:40.573Z",local_mutation,fix/dependabot-bun-lockfile
